@baseUrl = http://localhost:5000

# Credenciales del UserService proporcionado; uso local de la práctica.

### Endpoint público: disponible desde la base -> 200
GET {{baseUrl}}/

### B: sin credenciales -> 401 + WWW-Authenticate
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/basic/profile

### B: admin:passwordAdmin -> 200
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/basic/profile
Authorization: Basic YWRtaW46cGFzc3dvcmRBZG1pbg==

### B: estudiante:password123 -> 200, rol User
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/basic/profile
Authorization: Basic ZXN0dWRpYW50ZTpwYXNzd29yZDEyMw==

### B: contraseña incorrecta -> 401
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/basic/profile
Authorization: Basic YWRtaW46bWFs

### B: Base64 mal formado -> 401, nunca 500
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/basic/profile
Authorization: Basic !!!

### B: esquema incorrecto -> 401
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/basic/profile
Authorization: Bearer token-invalido

### Admin: sin credenciales -> 401 + WWW-Authenticate
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/basic/admin

### Admin: admin:passwordAdmin -> 200
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/basic/admin
Authorization: Basic YWRtaW46cGFzc3dvcmRBZG1pbg==

### Admin: estudiante:password123 -> 403 (autenticado, sin permiso)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/basic/admin
Authorization: Basic ZXN0dWRpYW50ZTpwYXNzd29yZDEyMw==

### Admin: contraseña incorrecta -> 401 + WWW-Authenticate
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/basic/admin
Authorization: Basic YWRtaW46bWFs
